  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the hail air fryer to 375f (190c).",
    "Slice the halloumi cheese into 1-inch thick pieces and coat lightly with olive oil.",
    "Place the cheese in the hail air fryer basket and cook for 5 minutes or until golden brown.",
    "Meanwhile, heat the olive oil in the tagine pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and sauté for 1 minute.",
    "Add the chili flakes, ground cumin, ground coriander, and salt-free seasoning blend. Stir to combine.",
    "Add the cooked cheese to the tagine pot and toss with the spice mixture.",
    "Cook for an additional 2-3 minutes or until the cheese is melted and the flavors are combined.",
    "Stir in fresh cilantro and serve immediately."
  ],
